    "identifier": "iron-guard",
    "description": "<p>As a requirement for this jutsu you must currently be gaining the benefit of any one Taijutsu Stance. You guard incoming damage, gaining a +4 bonus to your AC, potentially turning a hit into a miss. This bonus lasts until the beginning of your next turn.</p>\n<p>Regardless of a hit or miss until the beginning of your next turn, you maintain this stance gaining temporary hit points equal to twice your [Unarmed Damage] + your level.</p>",
